flowchart TD
    Cases[Manually reviewed after-sales cases] --> Core[AfterSalesBench core]
    Cases --> Planner[LLMPlannerBench]
    Core --> State[Case lifecycle and order-projection oracle]
    Planner --> Plan[Task-plan and slot coverage]
    State --> Control[Full vs handoff-all vs execute-on-intent]
    Plan --> Control
    Control --> Report[docs/EVALUATION.md + published_results.json]
    Report --> Regression[New failure becomes a named regression case]
    Regression --> CI[CI: pytest + offline core workflow]
    CI --> Cases
